 "assumptions": [
  "vifvec = vif::vifvec_rgb8 (lib.rs:530-544): u8-rounded round(0.299R+0.587G+0.114B) luma, f64 throughout (lib.rs:627-657). Requires min(W,H)>=72.",
  "build_bands per image (vifvec.rs:921-975): lo0 = corrDn 5x5 step1 reflect1 on WxH; per level l=1..4: band1 and band4 = corrDn 7x7 step1 at level dims; lo for levels<4 = corrDn 9x9 step2 (half-dims). Band dims at level l = lo_{l-1} ~ W/2^(l-1).",
  "corr_row per element: fh*fw taps x (1 mul + 1 add + 1 load), reflect1 borders counted as interior (vifvec.rs:507-560, 878-905).",
  "Selected subbands SUBS (vifvec.rs:52-60): levels (4,4),(4,1),(3,4),(3,1),(2,4),(2,1),(1,4),(1,1); winsize 3,3,5,5,9,9,17,17; offset 1,1,1,1,2,2,3,3.",
  "refparams_vecgsm per subband on REFERENCE band only (vifvec.rs:1088-1248): mean = 9-point overlapping sums over (ch-2)x(cw-2) positions (9 add+9 load per pos, /np div amortized); cu = 9x9 covariance over same positions: per pos 9 subs + 45 pairs mul+add; eig_symmetric 9x9 cyclic Jacobi ~5400 flops once per band (approximate, amortized to ~0.001/px); ss per non-overlapping 3x3 block: shared LU factor once + lu_apply (36 fwd fma + 36 bwd fma + 9 div + 9 fma dot + 1 div) per block (vifvec.rs:1200-1248, 977-1028).",
  "vifsub_est per subband (vifvec.rs:1458-1500, 1318-1440): per non-overlapping 3x3 block, winsize^2 sliding window sums {sx,sy,sxy,sx2,sy2}: per tap 2 loads + 3 mul + 5 add, then channel_gain (mul6 add8 div2 cmp6 incl TOL masks) per block.",
  "Pooling per subband (vifvec.rs:1545-1700, 1965-2054): cropped (nbw-2off)x(nbh-2off) blocks x 9 eigenvalues: per block per lam t1=log2(1+g^2*ss*lam/(vv+sn)) mul3 div1 add1, t2=log2(1+ss*lam/sn) mul1 div0 add1 (sn folded), 2 log2, 2 f64 adds; 9 lams total. Final score num/den.",
  "M=3 blocks (vifvec.rs:39); SIGMA_NSQ=0.4, TOL=1e-15."
 ],
